  "title": "Sousou no Frieren",
  "justification": "AniDB specials S1-S12 (Magic Episode 1-11 and the Special Episode) are TVDB season 0 episodes 1-12 \"Mini Anime Magic of ?? Vol.1-11\" and \"Special Edition\", by default. S13-S18 \"Magic Episode 12-17\" (2025-04-02 to 2025-09-03) are episodes 16-21 \"Vol. 12-17\" on the same dates. S19 \"Journey's Memory Special Video\" (2024-03-23) is episode 15 of that title, and S20, the Friday Anime Night fan appreciation special (2024-03-29), is episode 13 \"Fan Appreciation Event: A Journey to Understanding the Human Heart\" (2024-03-29). S21-S25 (the ZIP! feature, \"ga Mitaku Naru Mahou\", two \"Talk no Mahou\" specials and a theatre greeting) have no TVDB episode; by default they fell on the second season's shorts, so they are unmapped. TMDB 209867 season 0 orders them otherwise: episodes 1-11 are Magic Episode 1-10 and the Special, 12 \"Journey's Memory Special Video\" (S19), 13 Magic Episode 11 (S12), 14 \"Great Thanksgiving - The Path to Understand People's Hearts\" (S20) and 15-20 Magic Episode 12-17 (S13-S18), which a TMDB-only row places.",
